        "speaker_id": "person:speaker-02",
        "text": "Let me give you the version I actually believe. Threat modeling is a framing exercise \u2014 frame the decision wrong and you build the wrong defenses. We've seen this play out at teams using Notion. Once you internalize that, the rest of the decisions get easier.",
